'''The Yielding Mortality''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Imperial Staff}}.

==Mechanics==
{{sl|Summon Greater Harbinger of Brutality}}

This skill improves over the regular Harbinger of Brutality by causing Bleeding Enemies that you Kill to Explode, dealing 10% of their maximum Life as Physical Damage, similar to [[Gladiator]]'s {{psl|Gratuitous Violence}}.

Socketed gems are [[support gem|supported]] by level 1 {{il|Chance to Bleed Support}}. All support stats are accounted for, including the cost and reservation multiplier.

{{Item acquisition}}

