==Version history==
Until version 3.28.0, the item can only be acquired by applying {{il|Haemocombustion Scroll}} on {{il|The Enmity Divine}}. After that patch, '''The Yielding Mortality''' is in the core drop pool.
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.28.0|
* The following Currency can no longer be obtained: Deregulation Scroll, Electroshock Scroll, Fragmentation Scroll, Haemocombustion Scroll, Specularity Scroll, and Time-light Scroll.
* The following Uniques have been added to the core drop pool: The Immortal Will, The Shattered Divinity, The Surging Thoughts, The Tempest's Liberation, The Torrent's Reclamation, and The Yielding Mortality.
* Harbinger uniques now provide an additonal {{il|Fracturing Shard}} when [[vendor]]ed.{{Undocumented}}
}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* {{il|The Enmity Divine}} and Yielding Mortality Unique Staves now have 225-265 to 315-385 added Physical Damage (previously 160-185 to 200-225) and +60-80% to Damage Over Time Multiplier for Bleeding from Critical Strikes (previously 30-40%). Existing items can be updated using a Divine Orb.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
